<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends soft at 474.00/475.00/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends soft at 474.00/475.00/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed softer on Tuesday at 474.00/475.00 per dollar, traders said.</p>
<p>The currency should firm on Wednesday with dollar inflows expected ahead of the central bank's 60 billion bolivar TEM bill auction, they added.</p>
<p>&quot;The bolivar weakened today as there just wasn't demand,&quot; said one trader. &quot;It was a quiet session.&quot;</p>
<p>The bolivar closed Monday at 473.75/474.75 per dollar.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
